    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The Great Seer who leads the Vuku Orcs. He has more power than Chief Driko, and is held in high esteem as a divine being. He laments that his tribe is forced to wander through the hostile human realm. He hopes to take the tribe back to the northern homeland of the Orcs. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
